# --- Tier 0 mirror: 02_dashboards/Data/ (deploy-side copy of 01_data) ---
# The Tier 0 rules above are keyed to 01_data/ only, so the same content class
# reached git through the mirror path. Audited 2026-08-27: 805 tracked files
# under Data/90_INBOX/, including mail bodies and Outlook pulls.
# The published dashboards only ever fetch ../Data/dashboards/* (6 JSON/JS) plus
# one dealer-sales workbook — everything else in the mirror is incidental.
# NOTE: these rules are forward-looking. Git ignores nothing it already tracks,
# so the existing files stay tracked and stay in history until untracked.
02_dashboards/Data/12_raw/**
02_dashboards/Data/raw/**
02_dashboards/Data/90_INBOX/**
02_dashboards/Data/_INBOX/**
02_dashboards/Data/04_sales/**
